{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"Look up! The sky is busy today. Wally the weather map watches clouds move across the land.","words":[[0,0.33],[0.4,0.73],[1.02,1.2],[1.25,1.61],[1.68,1.8],[1.89,2.19],[2.26,2.82],[3.15,3.51],[3.58,3.65],[3.71,4.02],[4.09,4.35],[4.46,4.91],[4.99,5.43],[5.51,5.8],[5.85,6.26],[6.3,6.37],[6.44,7.25]]},{"text":"Weather tells us what the air feels like right now. It can be sunny, rainy, windy, or snowy.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.45,0.79],[0.87,1.02],[1.09,1.31],[1.36,1.45],[1.53,1.76],[1.86,2.19],[2.25,2.48],[2.53,2.79],[2.84,3.23],[3.61,3.77],[3.83,4],[4.08,4.19],[4.26,4.81],[4.95,5.41],[5.46,5.94],[6,6.2],[6.3,7.2]]},{"text":"Yesterday was warm and bright. Today feels cooler. Weather can change quickly.","words":[[0,0.6],[0.67,0.84],[0.97,1.42],[1.49,1.63],[1.71,2.31],[2.55,2.89],[2.97,3.29],[3.38,3.99],[4.38,4.74],[4.81,4.97],[5.04,5.43],[5.49,6.36]]},{"text":"Wind pushes air from place to place. It can be a soft breeze or a strong gust.","words":[[0,0.31],[0.4,0.82],[0.92,1.16],[1.23,1.44],[1.52,1.83],[1.86,1.93],[2.02,2.57],[2.95,3.1],[3.15,3.3],[3.35,3.46],[3.51,3.53],[3.61,3.98],[4.05,4.43],[4.49,4.63],[4.7,4.72],[4.79,5.17],[5.24,5.99]]},{"text":"Clouds gather water high in the sky. When drops grow heavy, rain falls down.","words":[[0,0.49],[0.56,0.87],[0.96,1.36],[1.46,1.78],[1.82,1.92],[1.96,2.03],[2.1,2.74],[2.98,3.19],[3.24,3.59],[3.65,3.9],[4,4.53],[4.82,5.07],[5.17,5.53],[5.6,6.36]]},{"text":"Cold weather can turn rain into snow. Tiny ice pieces fall softly to the ground.","words":[[0,0.41],[0.48,0.82],[0.91,1.08],[1.15,1.42],[1.5,1.74],[1.8,2],[2.08,2.58],[2.82,3.18],[3.26,3.53],[3.59,3.98],[4.06,4.33],[4.41,4.83],[4.9,4.97],[5.04,5.11],[5.16,5.99]]},{"text":"Wally shows weather on a map. Symbols help us see what the weather is like in many places.","words":[[0,0.4],[0.45,0.77],[0.86,1.24],[1.33,1.44],[1.5,1.52],[1.6,2.08],[2.4,2.91],[3,3.24],[3.31,3.41],[3.47,3.71],[3.77,3.97],[4.02,4.09],[4.14,4.49],[4.56,4.67],[4.75,5.05],[5.11,5.2],[5.28,5.54],[5.61,6.59]]},{"text":"People check the weather to choose clothes and plan their day.","words":[[0,0.43],[0.49,0.77],[0.85,0.92],[0.97,1.32],[1.41,1.5],[1.59,1.92],[1.97,2.44],[2.48,2.62],[2.71,3],[3.05,3.23],[3.3,3.99]]},{"text":"Farmers, pilots, and sailors all use weather maps to stay safe.","words":[[0,0.69],[0.74,1.26],[1.29,1.43],[1.51,2.1],[2.19,2.45],[2.54,2.76],[2.83,3.15],[3.2,3.5],[3.55,3.65],[3.71,3.98],[4.08,4.88]]},{"text":"At bedtime, we remember: weather changes often, and maps help us understand the sky.","words":[[0,0.2],[0.28,0.89],[0.92,1.03],[1.11,1.8],[2.09,2.43],[2.5,2.94],[3.02,3.53],[3.77,3.97],[4.06,4.39],[4.46,4.71],[4.78,4.9],[4.98,5.55],[5.61,5.68],[5.72,6.59]]}]}